## 2. Comprehensive Payment Reconciliation Flow

```
                     1. Payment API Trigger (POST /api/payments/ingest)
                                        │
                                        ▼
                  2. Ingest original payment into payments table
                          (status: "unmatched", source: "api")
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 3. Duplicate Check (transaction_reference & pattern)
                      ├── Duplicate Found ➔ Flag as Duplicate / Reject
                      └── Unique Payment ➔ Proceed
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 4. Create reconciliation_cases Record (status: "pending")
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 5. AI Reconciliation Agent Starts (Groq LLM Tool Calling)
                      ├── searchCompany(senderName, senderAccount)
                      ├── getActiveLoans(companyId)
                      ├── getDueRepayments(loanId)
                      └── getPaymentHistory(companyId)
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 6. AI Writes Recommendation to ai_recommendations
                      ├── confidence_score (e.g. 96%)
                      ├── reasoning_summary
                      └── status: "pending"
                                        │
                                        ▼
                 7. Human Accountant Verification (React Action Center)
                                        │
             ┌──────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────┐
             ▼                          ▼                          ▼
        [ REJECT ]                 [ PENDING ]                [ APPROVE ]
             │                          │                          │
             ▼                          ▼                          ▼
   - ai_rec.status='rejected'    - case.status='under_review' - Backend ACID Transaction:
   - case.status='rejected'      - Awaits manual               * Insert payment_allocations
   - payments.status='rejected'    investigation               * Update repayment_schedules
   - Logged in audit_logs                                      * Update payments (fully/partially_allocated)
                                                               * case.status='resolved'
                                                               * ai_rec.status='approved'
                                                               * Logged in audit_logs
```

